		}
	],
	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nxFaD0aMxv3c9mhR6",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 20, DX 9, IQ 8, HT 12, HP 20, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 12, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nSig2PJMUf9-RYwbe",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 33 (offense 19, protection 14), threat tier standard, appearing 3."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1qdmHs9Demkjb0Pv",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/merrow.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n_xE9JDAg2WBlci47",
			"text": "Independent build total: 84 points of racial traits plus 10 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nUkoVcWFcdjcK6htW",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Merrow (SRD 5.1); Merrow (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "noPGLK1s5UHul4RlW",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nSwKDx6U7H90MFdI9",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 300 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "njBFcPFQ9qPRopXit",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5; water Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nS7kiv2P67wqDVMmv",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nMS-IcArOP_8w1MYs",
			"text": "About 2.7 m, which is the SM +1 row; the published Strength discount for size applies at -10%."
		},
		{
			"id": "nGvYyu79R4DrrUFTD",
			"text": "ST 20 from Basic Lift and from the job: it hauls an armoured man off a deck and under."
		},
		{
			"id": "n7ZN-EYnADlO1py7Y",
			"text": "Amphibious and Oxygen Absorption together, like the merfolk: it fights in the water, drags prey into the water, and can follow onto a beach without inconvenience."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4g3c_ypGphIHP-0s",
			"text": "DR 2 is hide. A merrow wears nothing, so this is the one record among the armed folk here where the published DR is the whole story."
		},
		{
			"id": "niWAeH30dhQBu3ELn",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
